                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2fc46488-51c4-31b6-9117-d4a23c21578b",
                        "entry_id": "cd0d8af3-13ae-37e4-8850-356cdcaf824c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Spiel, bei dem die Summe der Gewinne und Verluste aller Spielteilnehmer gleich null ist"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Spieltheorie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "94e1c4df-3374-43bf-aa76-67d10ca87be0",
                                "sense_id": "2fc46488-51c4-31b6-9117-d4a23c21578b",
                                "text": "„Ein Nullsummenspiel, wie die Wirtschaftsprüfer Dohm, Schmidt und Janka in einem vertraulichen Brief feststellen: \"Zum Ende eines Buchungstages hatte keine Gesellschaft einen wesentlichen Soll- oder Habensaldo auf ihren Konten ausgewiesen.\"“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04f065cc-04e6-4fbf-8cfa-b6533540291c",
                                "sense_id": "2fc46488-51c4-31b6-9117-d4a23c21578b",
                                "text": "„Es gäbe im wahrsten Sinn des Wortes ein Nullsummenspiel zwischen den Kantonen und dem Bund.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "470dfc36-5d12-44d8-a3a3-43576fe0e250",
                        "source_entry_id": "cd0d8af3-13ae-37e4-8850-356cdcaf824c",
                        "source_sense_id": "2fc46488-51c4-31b6-9117-d4a23c21578b",
                        "source_sense_description": "Spiel, bei dem die Summe der Gewinne und Verluste aller Spielteilnehmer gleich null ist",
                        "target_lang_word": "zero-sum game",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "zero-sum game",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58f45b55-c435-3388-a7be-b436b44ca157",
                                        "entry_id": "47e22a70-29a4-3f3b-bc32-833d712a6e94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game (or a similar political or economic system) in which the gains of some players must equal the losses of others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44eb852c-4a14-4ddd-81fc-2ab785b66a17",
                                                "sense_id": "58f45b55-c435-3388-a7be-b436b44ca157",
                                                "text": "Dalio is right, but somewhat self-serving. If hedge-fund managers are playing a zero-sum game, what is their social utility? […] Can it really be in America’s interest to have so much of its young talent playing a zero-sum game?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f655976e-b0b2-477c-9eab-e94c549c5565",
                                                "sense_id": "58f45b55-c435-3388-a7be-b436b44ca157",
                                                "text": "A zero-sum game, as its name suggests, is one in which, whatever the outcome, the payoffs to the players add up to zero, which means that what one player gains, the other(s) must necessarily lose."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ef676fa-acfb-452c-a8ff-032e42ac0b18",
                                                "sense_id": "58f45b55-c435-3388-a7be-b436b44ca157",
                                                "text": "Listen, I know it's been hard / You know it’s no different for me / We’re less than a zero-sum game now / And baby, we both know that's not how it's supposed to be"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b26fd40-a17c-4bec-9b1a-49a256b0b7ad",
                                                "sense_id": "58f45b55-c435-3388-a7be-b436b44ca157",
                                                "text": "He said turning a lab-created animal into a wild population would be an “enormous challenge”, but the financial support for de-extinction research should not be seen as a “zero sum game”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11cfdbdb-7714-4179-8772-2d040efaacdd",
                                                "sense_id": "58f45b55-c435-3388-a7be-b436b44ca157",
                                                "text": "On the flight home after their first talks, a deflated Merkel concluded that Trump “looked at everything like the real estate developer he was before he entered politics” – as a zero-sum game."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
